hich licenses either zero for sign(0), so a zero lane would be authoring on a value the attribute leaves free rather than on the operation. The companion accum_losses output uses air.fast_fabs.v3f32 on the same residual and is left unobserved.","render_targets":[],"samplers":[],"stage":"kernel","texture_arrays":[],"textures":[],"threadgroup_memory":[],"vertex_inputs":[],"visible_function_references":[],"visible_function_tables":[]}
